021","versionKey":"base-text-2022","issuingAuthority":"Government of the United Arab Emirates (federal)","officialUrl":"https://uaelegislation.gov.ae/en/legislations/1541/download","pinpoint":{"label":"Article (6) Recruitment and Employment of Workers, clause (4)","quote":"The Employer is prohibited from charging the Worker the fees and costs of recruitment and employment or collecting them from him, whether directly or indirectly."},"jurisdiction":"AE","responsibleParty":"uae_employer","effectiveFrom":"2022-02-02","effectiveTo":null,"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","evidenceClass":"binding_official_rule"},"uncertaintyReasons":[],"suggestedQuestionOrStep":"Ask the employer to confirm, in writing, how the worker-paid costs in your documents align with the cited official provision."}],"summary":"Partial review: the document comparison finished, but the official-source check was not performed.","limitations":["2 possible official-source concerns were withheld because the cited rule could not be fully verified against its approved source. The document findings below still stand."],"officialNextSteps":[{"label":"BEOE: how to get an emigrant's protection (Pakistan)","url":"https://beoe.gov.pk/how-to-get-emigrants-protection"},{"label":"UAE Government: protection of workers’ rights","url":"https://u.ae/en/information-and-services/jobs/employment-in-the-private-sector/labour-rights"}]}}
